{"doc_id": "SYN_T0042_transcript_u001_v1", "recording": "SYN_T0042", "kind": "transcript", "utterance": 1, "topic": "greet", "text": "ayubowan, NSB eken යශෝධා kiyala kenek kathaa karanne."}
{"doc_id": "SYN_T0042_c2_u001_en_v1", "recording": "SYN_T0042", "kind": "en", "utterance": 1, "topic": "greet", "text": "Good afternoon, Yasodha here from NSB."}
{"doc_id": "SYN_T0042_c2_u001_si_v1", "recording": "SYN_T0042", "kind": "si", "utterance": 1, "topic": "greet", "text": "සුබ දවසක්, මම ජාතික ඉතිරිකිරීමේ බැංකුව ආයතනයෙන් යශෝධා."}
{"doc_id": "SYN_T0042_transcript_u002_v1", "recording": "SYN_T0042", "kind": "transcript", "utterance": 2, "topic": "name", "text": "mama Janaka, account holder."}
{"doc_id": "SYN_T0042_c2_u002_en_v1", "recording": "SYN_T0042", "kind": "en", "utterance": 2, "topic": "name", "text": "I am Janaka, the account holder."}
{"doc_id": "SYN_T0042_c2_u002_si_v1", "recording": "SYN_T0042", "kind": "si", "utterance": 2, "topic": "name", "text": "මම ජනක, ගිණුම් හිමියා."}
{"doc_id": "SYN_T0042_transcript_u003_v1", "recording": "SYN_T0042", "kind": "transcript", "utterance": 3, "topic": "relative", "text": "mage ayya ගයාන් අබේසේකර th ekka enawa."}
{"doc_id": "SYN_T0042_c2_u003_en_v1", "recording": "SYN_T0042", "kind": "en", "utterance": 3, "topic": "relative", "text": "My brother Gayan Abeysekara will come with me."}
{"doc_id": "SYN_T0042_c2_u003_si_v1", "recording": "SYN_T0042", "kind": "si", "utterance": 3, "topic": "relative", "text": "මගේ අයියා ගයාන් අබේසේකර මා සමඟ එනවා."}
{"doc_id": "SYN_T0042_transcript_u004_v1", "recording": "SYN_T0042", "kind": "transcript", "utterance": 4, "topic": "dob", "text": "upan dinaya kiyanna puluwanda?"}
{"doc_id": "SYN_T0042_c2_u004_en_v1", "recording": "SYN_T0042", "kind": "en", "utterance": 4, "topic": "dob", "text": "Can you confirm your date of birth?"}
{"doc_id": "SYN_T0042_c2_u004_si_v1", "recording": "SYN_T0042", "kind": "si", "utterance": 4, "topic": "dob", "text": "ඔබේ උපන් දිනය තහවුරු කරන්න."}
{"doc_id": "SYN_T0042_transcript_u005_v1", "recording": "SYN_T0042", "kind": "transcript", "utterance": 5, "topic": "dob", "text": "1984 April 16th."}
{"doc_id": "SYN_T0042_c2_u005_en_v1", "recording": "SYN_T0042", "kind": "en", "utterance": 5, "topic": "dob", "text": "Yes, 16th of April 1984."}
{"doc_id": "SYN_T0042_c2_u005_si_v1", "recording": "SYN_T0042", "kind": "si", "utterance": 5, "topic": "dob", "text": "1984.04.16."}
{"doc_id": "SYN_T0042_transcript_u006_v1", "recording": "SYN_T0042", "kind": "transcript", "utterance": 6, "topic": "address", "text": "letters ewanna 183/2, Circular Road, Kalutara ta."}
